  "sn41.3:2.4": "The Brahmajālasutta (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn1/en/sujato'>DN 1</a>). It is referred to by name at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-kd21/en/sujato#1.8.8'>Kd 21:1.8.8</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/vb17/en/sujato#21.3'>Vb 17:21.3</a>, and by the list of views, numbered sixty-three at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/snp3.6/en/sujato#42.1'>Snp 3.6:42.1</a> and sixty at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn8.2/en/sujato#5.1'>SN 8.2:5.1</a> = <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag21.1/en/sujato#9.1'>Thag 21.1:9.1</a>. ",
